<title>USA: Data Processing acquires Computec.</title>
<headline>Data Processing acquires Computec.</headline>
<dateline>NEWPORT BEACH, Calif. 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Data Processing Resources Corp on Wednesday said it has acquired Computec International Strategic Resources Inc for $19.6 million in cash and about 679,000 shares of its restricted stock.</p>
<p>The deal includes other compensation contingent on Computec pre-interest and pre-tax earnings through December 31, 1998.</p>
<p>Computec, based in Glendale, Calif., specializes in information technology staffing. Its revenues for the 12 months ended December 31, 1996 were about $19.3 million.  It employs about 110 people internationally and in the United States.</p>
